  "description": "eeCLOUD is a library that simplifies data management by adopting a NoSQL-like approach: each application automatically generates its own database, and in-memory objects correspond to tables. Data is treated as JSON, allowing you to work directly on the structures without having to write complex queries.\n\nThe library supports MySQL, MSSQL, and PostgreSQL, and introduces a single indexing standard that allows reading and writing not only to databases, but also to FTP servers using the same methods. It also offers advanced features such as integrated caching and the ability to cluster table data, ensuring improved performance and scalability.",
